# R41 T-FMT-A §4 — POS half of the for-iterable differential pair.
#
# AXIS CELL: the SAME position as the NEG sibling, but with the sigil in its
# legitimate iterable-MODIFIER slot (`Stmt::For.ownership = Move`, no parens).
#
# INTENDED: accepted before AND after `gg fmt`, and fmt must NOT gain parens
# here — the paren fix is a pure function of the parse, so it fires only when
# the emission would otherwise begin with a stripped sigil. Without this half,
# a formatter that parenthesised EVERYTHING would pass the NEG cell while
# churning every well-formed move-iterable in the tree.

void main():
    Vector[int] coll = [1, 2, 3]
    for i in ^coll:
        print(i)
